(   3. Directionality Criteria:) Tj
T*
(   - When [C]out > [C]in, [C]in / [C]out < 1, ln\([C]in / [C]out\) < 0, so Delta G < 0 \(Spontaneous) Tj
T*
(   passive inward diffusion\).) Tj
T*
(   - When [C]in > [C]out, [C]in / [C]out > 1, ln\([C]in / [C]out\) > 0, so Delta G > 0 \(Endergonic;) Tj
T*
(   requires coupled energy\).) Tj
T*
(   4. Calculation for 10-fold Inward Gradient \([C]out / [C]in = 10, so [C]in / [C]out = 0.10\) at) Tj
T*
(   310 K \(37 deg C\):) Tj
T*
(   Delta G = \(8.314 J/mol*K\) * \(310.15 K\) * ln\(0.10\) = 2,578.6 J/mol * \(-2.3026\) = -5,937.5 J/mol) Tj
T*
(   = -5.94 kJ/mol.) Tj
T*
(   Interpretation: Solute entry releases 5.94 kJ/mol of free energy, driving spontaneous downhill) Tj
T*
(   uptake.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
