T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   ABC Transporters and Multidrug Resistance:) Tj
T*
(   1. Conserved Modular Structure:) Tj
T*
(   ABC \(ATP-Binding Cassette\) transporters consist of four core domains:) Tj
T*
(   - Two Transmembrane Domains \(TMDs\): Typically 6 alpha-helices each \(12 total\), forming the) Tj
T*
(   substrate translocation pathway and conferring substrate specificity.) Tj
T*
(   - Two Nucleotide-Binding Domains \(NBDs\): Located on the cytoplasmic face, containing highly) Tj
T*
(   conserved motifs: Walker A \(P-loop\), Walker B, and the signature ABC C-motif \(LSGGQ\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Transport Mechanism \(ATP-Switch Model\):) Tj
