T*
(   Plakophilins\), which assemble Desmoplakin. Desmoplakin directly anchors intermediate filaments) Tj
T*
(   \(keratin in epithelia, desmin in cardiomyocytes\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Hemidesmosomes:) Tj
T*
(   - Function: Anchor the basal plasma membrane of epithelial cells to the underlying) Tj
