T*
(   - Structure: Linear 15-amino-acid peptide with alternating L- and D-amino acids.) Tj
T*
(   - Mechanism: Two gramicidin molecules in opposing leaflets dimerize head-to-head via 6) Tj
T*
(   intermolecular hydrogen bonds, forming a continuous 0.4 nm diameter cylindrical beta-helix) Tj
T*
(   across the membrane.) Tj
